window.CURRENT_TASK={"task_id": "L3-FUC-009-A7", "layer": "L3", "target_id": "FUC-009", "artifact_id": "FUC-009-A7", "title": "FUC-009 Manage Track Identity Classification / A7", "protocol_version": "L3_PURE_COVERAGE_3.0.0", "artifact_sha256": "43b4eb7634681cd5cf36aecebf941ca22ee6f0f021e6dcd05210a7250ceda221", "source_sha256": "40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99", "reference_sha256": "e144e11a564720733e2c0a12d3eec7df7e966bf7521b72cb637b0c8a66e96fc3", "reference_origin": "agent_reference_reused", "instructions": "<pre>本包明确复用冻结的 Agent 来源参照，属于人工覆盖复评，不构成“真人独立建立参照”。不展示任何候选评分。FULL为全部实质含义覆盖；PARTIAL不折半分；NOT_COVERED未覆盖；CONTRADICTED矛盾；UNRESOLVED未决。来源未决统一保留在分母，不能猜成已确认；技术失败另列且留在分母。允许七槽联合表达。</pre>", "material_html": "<h3>Manage Track Identity Classification</h3><p>给定参与者：C2 JU</p><div class=\"source\"><p>许可来源：milstd6016b_sec4</p><a href=\"assets/40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">打开完整来源 PDF（含原页图像）</a> · <a href=\"assets/40e0827f373b73731838c63950f540172969d6c83af6ebea4de3c9f3f5722e99.txt\" target=\"_blank\">同版全文文本</a></div><h3>冻结共同参照：已有 Agent 来源参照，非人工金标准</h3><pre>{&#x27;goal&#x27;: &#x27;Manage Track Identity Classification&#x27;, &#x27;actor&#x27;: &#x27;C2 JU&#x27;, &#x27;start_boundary&#x27;: &#x27;When a C2 JU originates, reports, receives, assumes reporting responsibility for, or resolves differences concerning identity classification of a surveillance track.&#x27;, &#x27;success_boundary&#x27;: &quot;The C2 JU reports and maintains the track&#x27;s standard identity and permitted identity amplifiers according to the surveillance rules and resolves identity differences through the specified automatic or manual procedures.&quot;, &#x27;in_scope&#x27;: [&#x27;Standard identity definitions and use in track identity classification&#x27;, &#x27;Exercise Track identity restrictions and Identity Amplifying Descriptor handling&#x27;, &#x27;Special Interest Indicator as identity amplification&#x27;, &#x27;Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, and related identity amplification accepted/retransmitted on R2 assumption&#x27;, &#x27;Identity reporting for inactive/limited-status interface units&#x27;, &#x27;Identity difference recognition, reporting, acceptance, rejection, and operator alerts&#x27;, &#x27;Environment/Category and Exercise Indicator conflict processing relative to identity&#x27;, &#x27;Use of PPLI Track Number and Identity Indicator in identity resolution&#x27;, &#x27;Change Data Order (J7.0 ACT=2) identity constraints&#x27;], &#x27;out_of_scope&#x27;: [&#x27;NonC2 JU transmission restrictions except where they constrain received surveillance information&#x27;, &#x27;Positional correlation algorithms except identity-related correlation restrictions&#x27;, &#x27;Track quality computation except where identity difference procedures interact with R2&#x27;, &#x27;Subsurface track reporting responsibility and manual-only correlation except identity field exchange&#x27;, &#x27;Electronic warfare product reporting responsibility except identity difference applicability&#x27;, &#x27;Network participation group scheduling or detailed word-by-word transmission rules&#x27;, &#x27;IFF/SIF code management&#x27;], &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 4, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Standard identity is provided in terms of the following definitions:&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 4, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Only tracks with standard identity of Friend can be modified by the exercise identity.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &quot;A track&#x27;s identity can be further amplified by designating it as a track of special interest. This is accomplished by setting the identity field as appropriate and by setting the special interest indicator.&quot;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 43, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;For each of the Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, and Special Interest Indicator fields which are implemented by a C2 JU, the JU shall accept all defined field values for retransmission and operator appreciation, in the event of assuming R2 for a previously-reported track.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 90, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The exchange of Surveillance data requires procedures to recognize and resolve differences in ID and Environment/Category.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 92, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;ID differences occur when a JU holds a local ID on a track (local data) which differs from the ID being reported on the interface (remote data).&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre><h3>交互目标 / goal</h3><pre>[goal:0 / CL-fffdc75f03aca17e] Ensure accurate and timely classification of tracks to support friendly force awareness and threat response</pre><h3>前置条件 / preconditions</h3><pre>[preconditions:0 / CL-0a33e89f980714f1 / step 1] The C2 JU has received a track report (e.g., J2 PPLI message) that requires identity classification.</pre><pre>[preconditions:1 / CL-7bab912a7cf946ee / step 2] The track is not yet classified under one of the standard identity definitions: Pending, Unknown, Assumed Friend, Friend, Neutral, Suspect, or Hostile.</pre><pre>[preconditions:2 / CL-c540cafd7140f565 / step 3] If the track is an exercise track, the Exercise Indicator in the J3 track messages must be set to distinguish it from live tracks.</pre><pre>[preconditions:3 / CL-3e317e548b0cf930 / step 4] Correlation restrictions do not apply if manual correlation is performed or if no conflicting conditions exist per paragraph 4.4.4.3.1f.</pre><pre>[preconditions:4 / CL-ee83ac2785b15b52 / step 5] For inactive or limited status interface units, reporting rules for real-time tracks must be followed if local sensor data is correlated.</pre><h3>触发条件 / trigger</h3><pre>[trigger:0 / CL-e29bef8d31c28ec5] Receipt of a J2 PPLI message, detection of decorrelation criteria being met, or receipt of a Drop Track message (J7.0) for an Interface Unit.</pre><h3>主流程 / main_flow</h3><pre>[main_flow:0 / CL-3709bab2088ca1a4 / step 0] The C2 JU assigns a standard identity to the track based on its characteristics, behavior, origin, or nationality using one of the following definitions: Pending (not yet subjected to identification), Unknown (evaluated but not identified), Assumed Friend (assumed friendly due to characteristics/behavior/origin), Friend (belonging to a declared friendly nation), Neutral (neither supporting nor opposing friendly forces), Suspect (potentially hostile), or Hostile (declared belonging to an opposing entity).</pre><pre>[main_flow:1 / CL-251d1d87a7de5605 / step 1] If the track is involved in an exercise and is a live track, the C2 JU sets the Exercise Indicator in the J3 track messages to distinguish it from other live tracks; only tracks with standard identity of Friend can be modified by the exercise identity.</pre><pre>[main_flow:2 / CL-dd03d688e760c00b / step 2] The C2 JU may further amplify the track’s identity using Special Interest Indicator, Exercise Indicator, Identity Amplifying Descriptor, Specific Type, Platform, Platform Activity, and Identity Confidence fields as defined in paragraph 4.4.2.1.</pre><pre>[main_flow:3 / CL-69a68b9639d3d040 / step 3] For retransmission purposes, if the C2 JU assumes R² for a previously-reported track, it shall accept all defined field values for retransmission and operator appreciation regardless of actual values implemented by the originating C² JU.</pre><pre>[main_flow:4 / CL-fc0d36aa839a44cf / step 4] If the C2 JU holds locally derived data that differs from the value accepted for retransmission (and is not No Statement), it shall report the locally derived data instead — except for non-NS data in Platform, Platform Activity, and Specific Type fields received from the controlling unit, which must be retransmitted regardless of locally derived data.</pre><pre>[main_flow:5 / CL-6b5775690cf73e2e / step 5] If the Special Interest Indicator is set to value 1, the C2 JU shall retransmit it as value 1 when assuming R².</pre><pre>[main_flow:6 / CL-79cf10bf2cd339be / step 6] Surveillance data reporting is initiated by the JU which first detects or initiates a track/point and makes it available for reporting on the interface; each track/point shall be assigned a TN from the JU’s allocated block at that time, and the JU shall have R² for the track/point.</pre><h3>备选流程 / alternative_flow</h3><pre>[alternative_flow:0 / CL-cbb47372c209bbf5 / step 0] The C2 JU may elect to accept, automatically, changes in Environment/Category, Identity or Exercise Indicator received in a track report with the PPLI Track Number and Identity Indicator set to value 1, provided the new identity is Friend and the locally held identity is not Hostile.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:1 / CL-625f5997a5acc3ed / step 1] When accepting a remote ID change, the C2 JU shall also retain the received values of the Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, and Special Interest Indicator fields for retransmission and operator appreciation, except when controlling units apply specific rules (paragraphs 4.7.1.2b and c).</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:2 / CL-7315f44fc0493e86 / step 2] If a Platform, Platform Activity or Specific Type value of 0 (No Statement) is received and a non-zero value is held locally, the C2 JU retains the local value as an exception to difference resolution rules.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:3 / CL-a6d0aff56a4dd4d6 / step 3] If an Air Platform value of 6 (Tanker), 7 (Tanker Boom Only), or 8 (Tanker Drogue Only) is held locally and a different value is received, an operator alert is optional.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:4 / CL-452fdb8f812fe61b / step 4] Differences in Environment/Category, ID, Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, Exercise Indicator and Special Interest Indicator field values may be resolved using the J7.0 (ACT = 2) message.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:5 / CL-085357adfefc90fe / step 5] If a correlation is found with a track for which another C2 JU has R2 and the TNs are different, the J7.2 (RV = 1) Correlation message shall be transmitted with the Source TN in the Header word of the J2 PPLI message as the Retained TN and the surveillance TN as the Dropped TN.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:6 / CL-ade64d44d44b910c / step 6] If a correlation is found with a track for which another C2 JU has R2 and the TNs are the same, the JU receiving the J2 shall accept the PPLI information into its surveillance database and disregard the J3 surveillance data on the specified track, except when Geodetic Position Quality in the PPLI message is set to value 0, in which case the surveillance track is accepted and the PPLI message shall be discarded.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:7 / CL-6628f31ba4233541 / step 7] Subsurface tracks shall not be correlated with IUs.</pre><pre>[alternative_flow:8 / CL-1a0df1cbce1e217e / step 8] Simulated tracks will not be correlated with live tracks; prior coordination with all interface participants is required when transmitting simulated tracks to ensure they are not assigned TNs from other systems&#x27; TN blocks.</pre><h3>异常流程 / exception_flow</h3><pre>[exception_flow:0 / CL-41c703393cda97e4 / step 1] Automatic correlation shall be inhibited if the two tracks have an Identity (ID) difference which constitutes a conflict, unless systems have an initialization parameter and operator selectable capability to inhibit this automatic restriction.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:1 / CL-34be1ee2bd13eca3 / step 2] Automatic correlation shall be inhibited if the two tracks have different Mode II codes and the local Mode II code is current, unless systems have an initialization parameter and operator selectable capability to inhibit this automatic restriction.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:2 / CL-266c4cd70a1a2121 / step 3] Automatic correlation shall be inhibited if both tracks are locally derived real-time tracks, i.e., being updated with local positional data.</pre><pre>[exception_flow:3 / CL-6d3c1f7061325efe / step 4] Automatic correlation shall be inhibited if either track has the Strength field set to a value greater than 1; however, systems shall not inhibit correlation if either track has Strength set to No Statement.</pre><h3>后置条件 / postconditions</h3><pre>[postconditions:0 / CL-5aeac765adedd59f / step 0] The track is assigned a standard identity classification (Pending, Unknown, Assumed Friend, Friend, Neutral, Suspect, or Hostile) based on its characteristics, behavior, origin, or nationality.</pre><pre>[postconditions:1 / CL-e5abf07f275cb8a1 / step 1] If the track is an exercise track, the Exercise Indicator in the J3 track messages is set to distinguish it from other live tracks; only tracks with standard identity of Friend can be modified by the exercise identity.</pre><pre>[postconditions:2 / CL-ad3e7bc314911776 / step 2] The track’s identity may be further amplified using Special Interest Indicator, Exercise Indicator, Identity Amplifying Descriptor, Specific Type, Platform, Platform Activity, and Identity Confidence fields.</pre><pre>[postconditions:3 / CL-20d757e505a82657 / step 3] If correlation is not found, the C² JU integrates the received J2 PPLI report into its surveillance database as part of the surveillance picture.</pre><pre>[postconditions:4 / CL-0a026ca17a9d51da / step 4] If decorrelation criteria are met, the PPLI and local track data are decorrelated, and the C² JU initiates a new surveillance track report with locally held data using a new track number; the PPLI Track Number and Identity Indicator field and the PPLI IPF/SIF Indicator field are both reported as No Statement.</pre><pre>[postconditions:5 / CL-ceb8f84c20edd943 / step 5] For inactive or limited status interface units, if reporting rules for real-time tracks apply, the C² JU assumes R² of the IU and reports it as a track or point on the Surveillance Network PG, with identity reported as Friend, and retains previously received PPLI values for Track Number, Platform, and Platform Activity.</pre><pre>[postconditions:6 / CL-56ae064ccfff9963 / step 6] Automatic correlation is restricted if conflicting conditions exist per paragraph 4.4.4.3.1f, unless operator-selectable capabilities are configured to inhibit such restrictions.</pre>", "groups": [{"key": "coverage", "title": "逐需求覆盖", "fields": [{"key": "label", "label": "覆盖标签", "type": "select", "required": true, "options": ["FULL", "PARTIAL", "NOT_COVERED", "CONTRADICTED", "UNRESOLVED", "TECHNICAL_FAILURE"]}, {"key": "location", "label": "输出位置/断言 ID/原文；无匹配填无", "type": "textarea", "required": true}, {"key": "reason", "label": "判定理由（列出遗漏的条件、否定、顺序或结果）", "type": "textarea", "required": true}], "rows": [{"title": "S16-03-R0001", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When classifying a track, the C2 JU shall use the defined standard identities: Pending, Unknown, Assumed Friend, Friend, Neutral, Suspect, or Hostile.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 4, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Pending - A track which has not been subjected to the identification process.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 4, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Hostile - A track declared to belong to any opposing nation, party, group, or entity, which by virtue of its behavior or information collected on it such as characteristics, origin or nationality contributes to the threat to friendly forces.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0002", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU may further amplify standard identity using the Special Interest Indicator, Exercise Indicator, Identity Amplifying Descriptor, Specific Type, Platform, Platform Activity, and Identity Confidence fields as applicable.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 4, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;These standard identity terms are further amplified by the Special Interest Indicator, Exercise Indicator and Identity Amplifying Descriptor, Specific Type, Platform, Platform Activity, and Identity Confidence fields.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0003", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When the Exercise Indicator is set to value 0, Non-Exercise Track, the C2 JU shall specify the standard identity of the track in the Identity field.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;exercise_indicator&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 4, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When the Exercise Indicator is set to value 0, Non-Exercise Track, the standard identity of the track shall be specified in the Identity field.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0004", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &quot;When the Exercise Indicator is set to value 1, Exercise Track, the C2 JU shall set the track&#x27;s standard identity to Friend and shall specify the exercise identity in the Identity Amplifying Descriptor field.&quot;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;exercise_indicator&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Exercise Indicator is set to value 1, Exercise Track, the standard identity of the track shall be Friend and the exercise identity shall be specified in the Identity Amplifying Descriptor field.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;top paragraph&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0005", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall not set the Identity Amplifying Descriptor field unless the Exercise Indicator is set to value 1, Exercise Track.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The Identity Amplifying Descriptor field shall not be set unless the Exercise Indicator field is set to value 1, Exercise Track.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;top paragraph&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0006", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;Only tracks with standard identity Friend shall be modified by the exercise identity.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 4, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Only tracks with standard identity of Friend can be modified by the exercise identity.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0007", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When an Exercise Track has Identity Amplifying Descriptor value 6, FAKER, the C2 JU shall identify the track as a friendly track acting as a hostile for exercise purposes.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;exercise_indicator&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;identity_amplifying_descriptor&quot;:&quot;6&quot;}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;a track with the Exercise Indicator set to value 1, Exercise Track, and the Identity Amplifying Descriptor set to value 6, FAKER, shall be identified as a friendly track acting as a hostile for exercise purposes.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;top paragraph&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0008", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When an Exercise Track has Identity Amplifying Descriptor value 5, JOKER, the C2 JU shall identify the track as a friendly track acting as a suspect for exercise purposes.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;exercise_indicator&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;identity_amplifying_descriptor&quot;:&quot;5&quot;}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;a track with the Exercise Indicator set to value 1, Exercise Track, and the Identity Amplifying Descriptor set to value 5, JOKER, shall be identified as a friendly track acting as a suspect for exercise purposes.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;top paragraph&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0009", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;For any Exercise Track, the C2 JU shall treat data concerning the track as artificial for exercise purposes except Track Number; specified tracking data; Simulation Indicator; Environment/Category; and specified air/surface status data, which shall not be artificial.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;exercise_indicator&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;For any track with Exercise Indicator set to value 1, Exercise Track, data concerning the track must be considered artificial, for exercise purposes, except that the following shall not be artificial:&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;top paragraph&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Tracking Data:  Latitude, Longitude, Altitude/Elevation/Depth, Course, Speed, Minute, Hour, and Track Quality.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;middle list&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0010", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When designating a track of special interest, the C2 JU shall set the identity field as appropriate and set the Special Interest Indicator.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 5, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &quot;A track&#x27;s identity can be further amplified by designating it as a track of special interest.  This is accomplished by setting the identity field as appropriate and by setting the special interest indicator.&quot;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;section 4.4.2.1.2&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0011", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;For each implemented Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, or Special Interest Indicator field, the C2 JU shall accept all defined field values for retransmission and operator appreciation when it assumes R2 for a previously reported track.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;assumes_R2&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 43, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;For each of the Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, and Special Interest Indicator fields which are implemented by a C2 JU, the JU shall accept all defined field values for retransmission and operator appreciation, in the event of assuming R2 for a previously-reported track.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0012", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When the C2 JU assumes R2, it shall retransmit values accepted for retransmission unless it holds locally derived non-No Statement data for the field that differs from the accepted value.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;assumes_R2&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 43, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Values accepted for retransmission shall be retransmitted if the JU assumes R2, unless the JU holds locally derived data other than No Statement (non-NS) for the field which differs from the value accepted for retransmission.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0013", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When the C2 JU holds locally derived non-No Statement data that differs from a value accepted for retransmission, the C2 JU shall report the locally derived data, except that non-No Statement Platform, Platform Activity, and Specific Type data received from the controlling unit shall be retransmitted regardless of locally derived data.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;assumes_R2&quot;:true,&quot;conflicting_local_data&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 43, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;In the latter case, the JU shall report the locally derived data.  As an exception, non-NS data for the Platform, Platform Activity, and Specific Type fields received from the controlling unit for the track shall be retransmitted regardless of locally derived data.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0014", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If the Special Interest Indicator is set to value 1, any C2 JU assuming R2 shall retransmit it as value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;special_interest_indicator&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;assumes_R2&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 43, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the Special Interest Indicator is set to value 1, it shall be retransmitted as value 1 by any JU assuming R2.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0015", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a C2 JU assumes R2 of an inactive or limited-status interface unit under the specified conditions, it shall report the Identity as Friend.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;assumes_R2_of_IU&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 8, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU assuming R2 of an IU reports it as a track or point on the Surveillance Network PG.  The type of surveillance message will depend upon the Environment/Category of the IU being reported.  The Identity shall be reported as Friend.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0016", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a C2 JU assumes R2 of an inactive or limited-status interface unit, it shall report the Track Number, Platform, and Platform Activity values received in previous PPLI messages.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;assumes_R2_of_IU&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 8, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The Track Number, Platform and Platform Activity values received in previous PPLI messages shall be reported.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0017", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a C2 JU assumes R2 of an inactive or limited-status interface unit, it shall report the PPLI Track Number and Identity Indicator as value 1 and maintain it if another C2 JU assumes R2.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;assumes_R2_of_IU&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 8, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The PPLI Track Number and Identity Indicator shall be reported as value 1, and shall be maintained if another C2 JU assumes R2 of the IU.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0018", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When reporting surveillance track information on the interface, the C2 JU shall follow the proper track reporting rules and shall keep the information as complete, accurate, and timely as possible.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 24, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The reporting of surveillance track information on the interface shall insure that:&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 24, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The information on the track is as complete, accurate, and timely as possible.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 24, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The proper rules for reporting a track are followed.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0019", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall recognize and resolve identity differences between local data and data reported on the interface by transmitting the appropriate J7 message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 92, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Interface procedures are required to recognize and resolve these ID differences.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 53, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Detection and resolution of Identity, Special Interest Indicator, Exercise Indicator, Platform, Platform Activity, Environment/Category, IFF/SIF, and Strength differences are resolved by transmitting the appropriate J7 message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0020", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When the R2 unit changes local identity data, it shall transmit the changed identity in the appropriate surveillance message at the next transmit opportunity and shall set the Identity Difference Indicator to value 0.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:true,&quot;local_identity_changed&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 94, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The R2 unit will transmit the changed identity in the appropriate surveillance message at the next transmit opportunity.  The Identity Difference Indicator shall be set to value 0.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0021", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A non-R2 C2 JU shall report changed local identity data in a J7.0 (ACT = 1) Difference Report message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:false,&quot;local_identity_changed&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 94, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;All other interface units will report the changed ID in a J7.0 (ACT = 1) Difference Report message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0022", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If a non-R2 interface unit is in control but does not have R2 for the Reference TN, its J7.0 (ACT = 1) Difference Report shall have the Controlling Unit Indicator set to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:false,&quot;controlling_unit&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 94, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the interface unit is in control but does not have R2 for the Reference TN the resultant J7.0 (ACT = 1) will have the Controlling Unit Indicator field set to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0023", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When the controlling unit receives an identity in a surveillance message different from local data, it shall automatically reject the received identity, transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message with its own data, and set the Controlling Unit Indicator to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;controlling_unit&quot;:true,&quot;received_identity_differs&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 94, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The controlling unit of the track shall automatically reject the received ID data and transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message with own unit data, and with the Controlling Unit Indicator field set to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0024", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a non-R2 C2 JU receives a surveillance message with Identity Difference Indicator 0 and a different identity, it shall resolve the difference according to Table 4.7-2 by automatically accepting, automatically rejecting, or alerting the operator for manual conflict resolution as directed.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:false,&quot;identity_difference_indicator&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 94, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the Identity Difference Indicator is set to value 0, the difference shall be resolved in accordance with Table 4.7-2.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 94, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &quot;If directed to automatically accept the remote ID, the system shall update the local ID with the remote ID. If directed to automatically reject the remote ID, the system shall transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 1) with local data. In all other cases the nonR2 unit&#x27;s operator shall be alerted&quot;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0025", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a non-R2 C2 JU receives a surveillance message with Identity Difference Indicator 1, it may either follow Table 4.7-2 while inhibiting a J7.0 (ACT = 1) until the indicator resets to 0, or take no action with an optional operator alert.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:false,&quot;identity_difference_indicator&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 94, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the Identity Difference Indicator is set to value 1, the nonR2 unit may either:&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Take no action with respect to the reported ID; an operator alert may be provided as a system option.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0026", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When an R2 JU receives a J7.0 (ACT = 1) identity difference message and is directed to automatically accept the remote identity, it shall update the local database and report the new track data in the appropriate surveillance message at the next transmit opportunity.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:true,&quot;directed_accept&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the R2 JU is directed to automatically accept the remote ID, the system shall update the local database and the new track data shall be reported in the appropriate surveillance message at the next transmit opportunity.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0027", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When an R2 JU receives a J7.0 (ACT = 1) identity difference message and is directed to automatically reject the remote identity, it shall discard the message and continue reporting the track with local data.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:true,&quot;directed_reject&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the R2 JU is directed to automatically reject the remote ID, the system shall discard the message and the track shall continue to be reported with local data.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0028", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When an R2 JU identifies an identity conflict, it shall alert the operator, continue reporting local identity data in the appropriate surveillance message, and set the Identity Difference Indicator to value 1 pending manual resolution.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:true,&quot;identity_conflict&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 96, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the R2 JU identifies that an ID conflict exists, the operator shall be alerted and the local ID data shall continue to be reported in the appropriate surveillance message, with the Identity Difference Indicator set to value 1. The conflict will be resolved by manual means.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0029", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When identity data are received for a TN for which the C2 JU does not have R2 and does not hold local positional data, it shall automatically accept the remote identity and place it in the database for retention.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;R2&quot;:false,&quot;local_positional_data&quot;:false}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 92, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Receipt of ID data on a TN for which the receiving JU does not have R2 and local positional data is not held will automatically be accepted and the remote ID placed in the database for retention.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0030", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall apply Table 4.7-2 identity-difference actions so that the matrix value determines no action, operator alert, automatic acceptance, or automatic rejection of the remote identity.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 97, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;0  = NO ACTION:  Take no action on the data link.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 97, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;1  = OPERATOR ALERT:  An Alert requiring the operator to take a MANUAL action to accept or reject the received ID.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 97, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;2  = ACCEPT:  Automatically accept received ID as LOCAL ID.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 97, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;3  = REJECT:  Automatically reject received ID.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0031", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;For the Table 4.7-2 cases marked with an asterisk, the C2 JU may provide a feature to automatically accept the received identity as the local identity.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;table_value_marked_star&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 97, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;* IN THESE THREE CASES ABOVE, SYSTEMS MAY HAVE A FEATURE TO AUTOMATICALLY ACCEPT RECEIVED ID AS LOCAL ID.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0032", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU may automatically accept Environment/Category, Identity, or Exercise Indicator changes received in a track report with PPLI Track Number and Identity Indicator set to 1 only if the new identity is Friend and the locally held identity is not Hostile.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;ppli_track_number_identity_indicator&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;new_identity&quot;:&quot;Friend&quot;,&quot;local_identity_not_hostile&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 98, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;a C2 JU may elect to accept, automatically, changes in Environment/Category, Identity nor Exercise Indicator received in a track report with the PPLI Track Number and Identity Indicator set to value 1, provided the new identity is Friend and the locally held identity is not Hostile.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0033", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When accepting a remote identity change, the C2 JU shall retain the received Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, and Special Interest Indicator values for retransmission and operator appreciation where those fields are implemented, subject to the stated exceptions.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;remote_identity_change_accepted&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 98, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When accepting a remote ID change, C2 JUs shall also retain the received values of the Platform, Platform Activity, Specific Type, and Special Interest Indicator fields, where those fields are implemented, for retransmission and operator appreciation.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0034", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a J7.0 (ACT = 2) Change Data Order is received and accepted, the C2 JU shall not transmit or accept differing data on the track until the 30-second lock-out has elapsed, except for the specified same-source, controlling-unit identity, and Exercise Status Order exceptions.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;change_data_order_accepted&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 99, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;once the J7.0 (ACT = 2) message has been received and accepted, a JU shall not transmit or accept any data on the track which differs from the data received in the J7.0 (ACT = 2) message until a 30-second lock-out has elapsed.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0035", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall not transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 2) Change Data Order containing an identity of Pending.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 99, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;JUs shall not transmit a J7.0 (ACT = 2) message containing an ID of Pending.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0036", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall not accept a J7.0 (ACT = 2) Change Data Order containing an identity of Pending.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;received_id&quot;:&quot;Pending&quot;}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 99, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Units receiving a J7.0 (ACT = 2) Change Data Order message containing an ID of Pending shall not accept that order.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0037", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If a controlling C2 JU does not accept a Change Data Order for a controlled track, it shall transmit its locally held data in a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message with the Controlling Unit Indicator set.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;controlling_unit&quot;:true,&quot;change_data_order_rejected&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 100, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If these changes are not accepted, the controlling unit shall transmit its locally held data in a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message with the Controlling Unit Indicator field set.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0038", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If the controlling C2 JU also has R2 and rejects a Change Data Order, it shall continue transmitting the locally held identity data in a J3.X message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;controlling_unit&quot;:true,&quot;R2&quot;:true,&quot;change_data_order_rejected&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 100, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;In addition, if the controlling unit has R2, it shall continue to transmit the locally held ID data in a J3.X message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0039", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall treat tracks as having conflicting identities for correlation processing when the ID difference is code 1 in Table 4.7-2, or code 1* when the system processes it as a conflict, except that Hostile versus Pending shall not be a conflict, or when the Exercise Indicators differ.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 36, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Two tracks shall be considered to have conflicting IDs for correlation processing if:&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 36, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;except that Hostile vs. Pending shall not be considered a conflict for correlation processing.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 36, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;One track has the Exercise Indicator set to value 0 and the other has it set to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0040", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If conflicting identities are the only correlation restriction, the C2 JU shall alert the operator to change local identity data, transmit an identity difference report, confirm the restriction, or conduct voice coordination.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;identity_conflict_only_correlation_restriction&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 36, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If conflicting IDs is the only correlation restriction, the operator shall be alerted.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 36, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Change the local ID or the Exercise Indicator and ID, thereby allowing automatic correlation&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 37, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Confirm the restriction, thereby inhibiting the \\ncorrelation&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}, {&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 37, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Conduct voice coordination to resolve the situation.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0041", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When an identity conflict is resolved before correlation execution, the C2 JU shall test the TN to be retained for decorrelation once before executing the correlation.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;identity_conflict_resolved&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 37, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the above actions result in resolution of the ID conflict, the TN to be retained shall be tested for decorrelation in accordance with paragraph 4.4.4.3.2a before executing the correlation, except the test shall be conducted only once.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0042", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A C2 JU with R2 on a track shall retain reporting responsibility until it is relinquished in accordance with the R2 rules or until the track is dropped.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;CONFIRMED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 52, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A JU with R2 on a track retains the responsibility until it is relinquished in accordance with the above rules or until the track is dropped.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0043", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall use the Platform and Platform Activity fields to further amplify the identity of the reported track in specific terms, dependent on Environment/Category.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 6, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The Platform and Platform Activity fields are Environment/Category dependent \\nand serve to further amplify the identity of the reported track in specific \\nterms, such as fighter, close air support.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0044", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall use Specific Type to further amplify platforms in each Environment/Category, normally provided by status report from interface units or intelligence amplification reports.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 6, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Specific type is Environment/Category dependent and serves to further amplify \\nplatforms in each Environment/Category.  Specific type is normally provided \\nby status report from interface units or by intelligence amplification \\nreports on surveillance tracks, or in the J3.2, J3.3, J3.4, J3.5, and J3.6 \\nmessages.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0045", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall process and resolve Environment/Category conflicts prior to the resolution of ID conflicts when receiving a Surveillance message or J7.0 (ACT=1) message with differing Environment/Category and ID.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Environment/Category and ID differ from local data&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 90, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When a JU receives a Surveillance message or a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message in \\nwhich the air, surface (maritime), or land (ground) Environment/Category and \\nID are different from the local Environment/Category and ID, the \\nEnvironment/Category conflict shall be processed and resolved prior to the \\nresolution of the ID conflict.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0046", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If an Environment/Category conflict is detected, the C2 JU shall perform no further processing to detect an ID conflict.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Environment/Category conflict is detected&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 90, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;That is, if an Environment/Category conflict \\nis detected, no further processing to detect an ID conflict need occur.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0047", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall resolve Exercise Indicator conflicts prior to ID or Identity Amplifying Descriptor Conflict resolution.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Exercise Indicator differs from local data&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 91, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Exercise Indicator conflicts will be resolved prior to ID or Identity \\nAmplifying Descriptor Conflict resolution.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0048", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;When a JU receives a Surveillance message or J7.0 (ACT=1) message where the Exercise Indicator is different from local Exercise Indicator data, a conflict exists and the operator shall be alerted for manual resolution.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Exercise Indicator differs from local data&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 90, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;When a JU receives a Surveillance message in which the Exercise Indicator is different from local Exercise Indicator data or a J7.0 (ACT = 1) message in which the Exercise Indicator is different from the local Exercise Indicator, a conflict exists and the operator shall be alerted for manual resolution.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;Paragraph 4.7.1.2 continued&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0049", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU shall process Identity Amplifying Descriptor conflicts in the same manner as ID conflicts.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 91, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Identity Amplifying Descriptor \\nconflicts are processed in the same manner as ID conflicts.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0050", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A controlling unit receiving a J7.0 (ACT=1) message reporting an ID different from local ID data shall automatically reject the received ID and originate a J7.0 (ACT=1) message containing local ID data with Controlling Unit Indicator set to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Controlling unit receives J7.0 (ACT=1) with different ID&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;(1)  Controlling Unit.  A controlling unit receiving a J7.0 (ACT \\n= 1) message which reports an ID of a locally-controlled track different from \\nthe local ID data shall automatically reject the received ID and originate a \\nJ7.0 (ACT = 1) message containing the local ID data and with the Controlling \\nUnit Indicator field set to value 1.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0051", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;If the controlling unit also has R2, the next scheduled track update shall contain local data and the Identity Difference Indicator shall be set to value 0.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Controlling unit has R2&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;If the controlling unit also has R2, the \\nnext scheduled track update by the appropriate surveillance message shall \\ncontain local data and the Identity Difference Indicator shall be set to \\nvalue 0.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0052", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;All interface units receiving a J7.0 (ACT=1) message from the controlling unit (Controlling Unit Indicator = 1) shall automatically accept the remote data for database update.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Receiving J7.0 (ACT=1) from controlling unit&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;(2)  Other Interface Units.  All interface units receiving a J7.0 \\n(ACT = 1) message from the controlling unit (Controlling Unit Indicator field \\nset to value 1) shall automatically accept the remote data for database \\nupdate.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0053", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The C2 JU with R2 for the track shall report the updated track information in the appropriate surveillance message at the next transmit opportunity and set the Identity Difference Indicator to value 0 after accepting controlling unit data.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;C2 JU has R2 AND accepted controlling unit data&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The JU with R2 for the track shall report the updated track \\ninformation in the appropriate surveillance message at the next transmit \\nopportunity and shall set the Identity Difference Indicator to value 0.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0054", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;The ID received in a J7.0 (ACT=1) message with Controlling Unit Indicator set to 0 shall be processed in accordance with Table 4.7-2.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Receiving J7.0 (ACT=1) with Controlling Unit Indicator = 0&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 95, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;The \\nID received in the J7.0 (ACT = 1) message, with the Controlling Unit \\nIndicator field set to value 0, shall be processed in accordance with Table \\n4.7-2.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0055", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;Non-R2 C2 JUs receiving a J7.0 (ACT=1) with Controlling Unit Indicator 0 may either follow Table 4.7-2 (inhibiting J7.0 transmission until reset if conflict) or take no action.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;Non-R2 JU receives J7.0 (ACT=1) with Controlling Unit Indicator = 0&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 96, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;(b)  NonR2 JUs.  NonR2 JUs may either: \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n1  Follow the actions in Table 4.7-2, but where a \\nconflict is indicated the unit shall inhibit transmission of the J7.0 (ACT = \\n1) until the surveillance message is received with the Identity Difference \\nIndicator set to value 0, or \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n2  Take no action with respect to the reported ID; an \\noperator alert may be provided as a system option.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0056", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;Difference resolution of Platform/Platform Activity/Specific Type and Special Interest Indicator field values is not mandatory.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: None, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 98, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;Difference resolution of the Platform/Platform Activity/Specific Type and \\nSpecial Interest Indicator field values is not mandatory.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}, {"title": "S16-03-R0057", "html": "<pre>{&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;A change in the ID of a given track shall include the appropriate evaluation of the Platform/Platform Activity/Specific Type and Special Interest Indicator fields, and shall be included in the J3.X or J7.0 (ACT=1) message.&#x27;, &#x27;conditions&#x27;: &#x27;{&quot;ID of a track changes&quot;:true}&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27;: &#x27;REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED&#x27;, &#x27;evidence&#x27;: [{&#x27;pdf_page_1based&#x27;: 98, &#x27;quote&#x27;: &#x27;A change in the ID \\nof a given track shall include the appropriate evaluation of the \\nPlatform/Platform Activity/Specific Type and Special Interest Indicator \\nfields, and shall be included in the J3.X or J7.0 (ACT = 1) message.&#x27;, &#x27;visual_region_description&#x27;: &#x27;&#x27;}]}</pre>"}], "repeat": false, "min_rows": 0}], "blockers": [], "requirement_meta": [{"id": "S16-03-R0001", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0002", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0003", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0004", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0005", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0006", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0007", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0008", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0009", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0010", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0011", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0012", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0013", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0014", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0015", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0016", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0017", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0018", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0019", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0020", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0021", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0022", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0023", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0024", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0025", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0026", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0027", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0028", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0029", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0030", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0031", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0032", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0033", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0034", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0035", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0036", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0037", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0038", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0039", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0040", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0041", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0042", "status": "CONFIRMED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0043", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0044", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0045", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0046", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0047", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0048", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0049", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0050", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0051", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0052", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0053", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0054", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0055", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0056", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}, {"id": "S16-03-R0057", "status": "REFERENCE_UNRESOLVED"}], "no_content": false, "material_sha256": "612d61fc22f33e5578908b4834d1d1c841720a43435c9ff329418b7c41faa1f0"};
